      en: ["The fort was constructed between 1910 and 1912.", "It served as the capital of the anti-colonial Dervish State.", "In 1920, it was the site of one of Africa's first aerial bombardments.", "The main Silsilad complex featured walls over 10 meters high.", "The leader Mohammed Abdullah Hassan was known as the 'Mad Mullah'.", "Taleh was added to the UNESCO World Heritage Tentative List in 2007."],
      es: ["Construido en 1910-1912 por Diiriye Guure.", "Material: piedra de coral y arcilla.", "Varias torres y muros defensivos.", "Bombardeado por los británicos en 1920.", "Restauración desde 2015.", "Símbolo de la resistencia somalí."],
      pt: ["Construído em 1910-1912 por Diiriye Guure.", "Material: pedra de coral e argila.", "Várias torres e muros defensivos.", "Bombardeado pelos britânicos em 1920.", "Restauração desde 2015.", "Símbolo da resistência somali."],
      fr: ["Construit entre 1910 et 1912 par Diiriye Guure.", "Matériau : pierre corallienne et argile.", "Plusieurs tours et murs défensifs.", "Bombardé par les Britanniques en 1920.", "Restauration depuis 2015.", "Symbole de la résistance somalienne."],
