      en: ["The fort was constructed around 1910 under the direction of Sayyid Mohammed Abdullah Hassan.", "It functioned as a strategic Dervish stronghold against British colonial expansion.", "The fortification walls are notably thick, built using locally quarried stone and lime mortar.", "The port of Eyl was essential for receiving supplies and equipment for the Dervish forces.", "The structure suffered significant damage during British aerial raids in the year 1920.", "The ruins are now preserved as a key national heritage site representing Somali independence."],
